  "Each value describes one packet sent before the handshake, as a sequence of tags: <b 0x...> static bytes, <t> a 4-byte timestamp, <r N> random bytes, <rc N> random letters, <rd N> random digits (N up to 1000). Example: <b 0xd100000001><rc 8><t><r 50>. These are client-only parameters, they are never written into the server config; empty values are skipped, and an empty I1 turns the whole set off. Keep each packet under about 1472 bytes or it is fragmented on the way out, which is the signature this is meant to avoid. A config that grows past the QR code limit can still be downloaded as a file.": "每個值描述握手之前傳送的一個封包，由一串標籤組成：<b 0x...> 靜態位元組，<t> 4 位元組時間戳，<r N> 隨機位元組，<rc N> 隨機字母，<rd N> 隨機數字（N 最大為 1000）。範例：<b 0xd100000001><rc 8><t><r 50>。這些是僅用戶端參數，永遠不會寫入伺服器設定檔；空值會被跳過，而 I1 為空會關閉整套設定。請讓每個封包保持在約 1472 位元組以下，否則它在發出時會被分片，而這正是要避免的特徵。即使設定檔超出了二維碼的限制，也仍然可以下載為檔案。",
