  "Subnet, MTU, DNS, endpoint and the AmneziaWG 3.1 obfuscation parameters are generated automatically. Tick \"Advanced settings\" to fill them in yourself.": "子網路、MTU、DNS、端點和 AmneziaWG 3.1 混淆參數都會自動產生。勾選「進階設定」可自行填寫。",
