  "The AmneziaVPN app replaces the MTU with {{.AppMTU}} on import. After importing, set MTU to {{.MTU}} in the app's AmneziaWG connection settings, or import the .conf instead - it keeps the MTU": "AmneziaVPN 應用程式在匯入時會把 MTU 替換成 {{.AppMTU}}。匯入後請在應用程式的 AmneziaWG 連線設定中把 MTU 設為 {{.MTU}}，或者改為匯入 .conf 檔案——它會保留 MTU",
  "The placeholders are what the engine accepts, not what is wise. On top of them S1 must fit MTU-148, S2 must fit MTU-92, S1+56 must not equal S2, and H1-H4 must all differ.": "這些佔位值是引擎接受的範圍，而不是推薦值。除此之外：S1 必須小於 MTU-148，S2 必須小於 MTU-92，S1+56 不得等於 S2，並且 H1-H4 必須互不相同。",
  "These defaults are used for new clients when \"Apply I-settings\" is enabled.": "啟用「應用 I-設定」時，新增用戶端會使用這些預設值。",
